{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/c/16cfa01b471fbe2f413ddbd3444fc84be24b5245.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-4|+|x-3|&lt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/d/0fd7660344ebc45a2bfd1236027ea094ac5083a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0&lt;a&lt;.01\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ .01&lt;a&lt;1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0&lt;a&lt;1\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 0&lt;a \\le 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a350f1766050e86a41bb112ce9f51f8984233924.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-4| = |-(x-4)| = |4-x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"242\" height=\"20\" />.  \n</p><p>By the triangle inequality, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84dc63a7d0ddf6eec04106e3da3bbcee9eb6fe69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-4| + |x-3| = |4-x| + |x-3| \\geq |(4-x)+(x-3)| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"20\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e67500c3743a01454142b917acf06de277e14f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ a&gt;1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> on a number line.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c546728a959709cd0952de175606f1aecff7c0db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-4| + |x-3| = AX + BX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"235\" height=\"20\" />.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d774222e42e2dd52f61df688f1797537f3c08f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\leq x \\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/1/5915b1a69f291bb768a8a736370c74058d947a6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X \\in \\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b143d2903c66af6f07366447ba9ffc04d2223db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AX + BX = AB = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"168\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dd301c6c773458ccd5c1e20cc38ca982f9ab512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is to the left of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/e/49e005467e970b7fbe70a2339eb3eb10368b2090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AX + BX = AX + (AX + AB) = 2AX + 1 &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"385\" height=\"20\" />.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/5/af505a7aebbcf901ae1ededba228f8acc738b337.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is to the right of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b572100d4f4d55325c449ff11a563d40ca2db8eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AX + BX = (AB + BX) + BX = 2BX + 1 &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/1/af11cb44588c45e21e6c7c12461b6f0ab7b65f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq AX + BX &lt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"153\" height=\"17\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b709fc7a3878ac53c1719b01f7f9900b886a7e48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ a &gt; 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" /> is the correct choice.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d069076bf6e1b015af69bdf2e125eb094c26baa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; |x-4|+|x-3|=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"20\" />.  Of the choices, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e67500c3743a01454142b917acf06de277e14f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ a&gt;1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" /> is satisfied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017083812\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 291/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2984/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6024/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.840      1 -total\n 64.56%   10.226      1 Template:AHSME_40p_box\n 33.98%    5.383      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17663:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017083812 and revision id 291514. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}